{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[thyroid]] [[gland]]}}

# {{context|anatomy}} A large butterfly-shaped [[endocrine gland]] situated on the front of the neck that produces various [[hormone]]s.  Removal due to thyroid [[cancer]] is termed a total [[thyroidectomy]].

